# kotlinx.serialization keeps its generated serializers
-keepattributes *Annotation*, InnerClasses
-dontnote kotlinx.serialization.**
-keepclassmembers class kotlinx.serialization.json.** { *** Companion; }
-keep,includedescriptorclasses class com.modalpha.app.**$$serializer { *; }
-keepclassmembers class com.modalpha.app.** { *** Companion; kotlinx.serialization.KSerializer serializer(...); }
-dontwarn okhttp3.internal.platform.**
-dontwarn org.conscrypt.**
-dontwarn org.bouncycastle.**
-dontwarn org.openjsse.**
